        {
          "text": "Lisuuvira lilahi litaveeye nu vudamanu imbiri wa Nyasaye Baba wiitu ni yili: kokonya avavisandu na vakunzakali mu likuba ikivi liavo, nu kwilinda ligali umwene avuli kwononywa ni ivindu vie kivala.",
